{"id":"anweisung","lemma":"Anweisung","pos":"noun","rank":1964,"glosses":["directive, order","instructions"],"ipa":"/ˈʔanˌvaɪ̯zʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/De-Anweisung.ogg/De-Anweisung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Anweisung","plural":"Anweisungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Was sind meine Anweisungen?","en":"What are my orders?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe meine Anweisungen.","en":"I have my orders.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie die Anweisungen gelesen?","en":"Have you read the instructions?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to read","l":"lesen"}]},{"text":"Seine Anweisung ist immer sehr behutsam.","en":"His advice is always very sensible.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"gentle, cautious"}]},{"text":"Ich mache es nach deinen Anweisungen.","en":"I'll do it according to your instructions.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null]}]}